Attribute order on an unwrapped heading

```
> {a=b .c}
> # Auto

> {#x a=b}
> # Written

:::
{a=b .c}
# Divved
:::
.
<blockquote>
  <h1 a="b" class="c" id="Auto">Auto</h1>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
  <h1 id="x" a="b">Written</h1>
</blockquote>
<div>
  <h1 a="b" class="c" id="Divved">Divved</h1>
</div>
```
